  "Seasonal adjustment differs by source. US M1, M2 and M3 and the ECB series are seasonally adjusted. The old Japanese M1 and M2+CDs and the Chinese series are not, so their levels show year-end and Lunar New Year swings. Year-on-year views are not affected."
